    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a4/Raval_QBULB_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241130025708\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Raval QBULB \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a4/Raval_QBULB_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241130025708\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1069\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Raval QBULB .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Raval_QBULB_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eDemon Helm Soldier\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA beatiful warrior whose ancestors were magical beasts called demons. Contrary to her petite form, she is a Master in battle, using brute strength so swing her gigantic metal staff. She fights other beatiful warriors to the sole purpose of comparing her strenght to theirs.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c9/Raval_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241130025348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Raval Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c9/Raval_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241130025348\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1020\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Raval Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Raval_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820023815\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: f